 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AY-e-BhphJQQ7kNvwG6eGVx&_nc_oc=AdolusjBESI-EH6JdI9BSDtWiuqpgYzDvPf9YHNyDfS0tGaUSNDM2FwliC7SHZ2wJ3A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEH8uO1i9Cm5mRDsdpCpoZvlABIjAcXSRtdg-bFUPfhMw&oe=6A82EE01"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0jagG1L0O-EQ7kNvwFYyoTc&_nc_oc=Adpxg8tXYQPZqvvTwKWRsu0NQMNPXus8qEZ0sb5e1wG7SSvJadm36034AVxu8_om6kU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHDINMbeas9Ln-jPSj57CrGwhRET30eVOneHSijZ0Wg-Q&oe=6A82FB66"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EDUlIqomlJoQ7kNvwGf9wUH&_nc_oc=Adp6lflpiGeteHdknMOHGzu2H1HR21BWvWk0W7mlXgMVyJQ31fTGDIUi3XkBB1CzqWk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQExkcJqcMEE4kDA1yHB85UrCu3eGJWmzLqM1KArfe82Vw&oe=6A83055C"}, {"fil